* ---- Grouped substrate taps (ptap1) ----
* In flat mode KLayout extracts the guard rings of the pad ring as ONE ptap1 per net pair.
* The per-cell ptap1 of the CDL were removed and are placed here with the exact values
* of the extracted netlist (chip_top_extracted.cir).
R_ptap_0 IOVSS VSS ptap1 A=173395.07965e-12 P=40827.778e-6
R_ptap_1 VSS VSS ptap1 A=726.8736e-12 P=4895.216e-6
.ends SoC6169

* ------------------------------ IO library ------------------------------
.subckt sg13cmos5l_IOPadIOVss vdd vss iovdd iovss vsub
XI3 iovss iovss iovdd vsub sg13cmos5l_DCNDiode
XI2 iovss iovdd iovss sg13cmos5l_DCPDiode
.ends sg13cmos5l_IOPadIOVss

.subckt sg13cmos5l_DCPDiode anode cathode guard
DD1 anode cathode dpantenna m=1 w=1.26u l=27.78u a=35.003p p=58.08u
DD0 anode cathode dpantenna m=1 w=1.26u l=27.78u a=35.003p p=58.08u
.ends sg13cmos5l_DCPDiode

.subckt sg13cmos5l_DCNDiode anode cathode guard vsub
DD1 vsub cathode dantenna m=1 w=1.26u l=27.78u a=35.003p p=58.08u
DD0 vsub cathode dantenna m=1 w=1.26u l=27.78u a=35.003p p=58.08u
.ends sg13cmos5l_DCNDiode

.subckt sg13cmos5l_IOPadIOVdd vdd vss iovdd iovss vsub
XI1 net4 iovss iovdd vsub sg13cmos5l_Clamp_N43N43D4R
XI3 iovdd net1 vsub sg13cmos5l_RCClampResistor
XI2 net4 net1 iovss iovdd vsub sg13cmos5l_RCClampInverter
.ends sg13cmos5l_IOPadIOVdd

.subckt sg13cmos5l_RCClampInverter out in iovss supply vsub
MN1 iovss in iovss vsub sg13_hv_nmos m=1 w=63.000u l=9.5u ng=7
MN3 out in iovss vsub sg13_hv_nmos m=1 w=54.000u l=500.0n ng=6
MN0 iovss in iovss vsub sg13_hv_nmos m=1 w=63.000u l=9.5u ng=7
MN2 out in iovss vsub sg13_hv_nmos m=1 w=54.000u l=500.0n ng=6
MP0 out in supply supply sg13_hv_pmos m=1 w=350.000u l=500.0n ng=50
.ends sg13cmos5l_RCClampInverter

